{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a1b5aca6d0db236fce55e499be24dd2a010d954560b44b5a0e6c0bb12d02c236",
      "text": "Hello, Gadget Channel! Today is a\nlive debut of new equipment, straight\nfrom the crime scene!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:37a590739545b5aa1eb2aa08546032798ac70b110d91353bfc8f637734358f45",
      "text": "You're streaming now?! It's\ndangerous, back up!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5fab78a7d5f135dbe5547487830d980f04a689978ee050d2be0a36d65818d724",
      "text": "You don't get it, Miss Nate. The\ndeveloper explaining it with his own\nbody is what makes it exciting!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f88dce17dff64beca93ada2965cce4fd752ba7a6dbe572700e7d46815df206df",
      "text": "—Now, Mr. Alk! The gadget's debut\nbattle, let's go!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ca7fc007227cec074d84145ac2b550e9d33610da7fbaa4000474597fdae6fd9d",
      "text": "Wh-what?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "28": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1be4b1d395fedb1005e5b0ea162a30406844142a435f814ce7645cefb44aa1c3",
      "text": "...Luvetra. Brother.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:da41a1d8d39f7087c09e5346a35a06bade46a368b8cd647bf40b5b0cc4cee4d9",
      "text": "Invetra. Are you still wasting your\nlife on that stuff? Wake up\nalready.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0a5ba1f0b3f564adf77aa342f69ae6a23ef713f9fcb02931872294544f969204",
      "text": "I still believe in our cool from\nback then. I'll chase it anywhere.\nThat hasn't changed since then.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c71f1b65320a7ca8d2ad5ae1026611bf4c1dff20bb6859f62e7daf1a31ba72c2",
      "text": "Brothers fight, fine. But do you\nknow your position? This is PBC\nturf.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c94bf83e555c0a91088989f6947cd8b84afba99a5fcd8c5444e64f7d597e15bf",
      "text": "Even if you're from big security\nfirm Megatro Techno...are you\npicking a fight?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "43": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f7265b74a7081078c29e8d20c08d0d36643e040a6e0d928ce30c3f807ad3dab1",
      "text": "Yes, I am. You're watching,\nso explain it, King Johnson.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:422a9be42fcf659925fbb709ceaf7e2ae62d59a9c5cb94b0b68b183a6ac73da4",
      "text": "Hello, hello! It's me! He made an\noffer just now! It sounds fun,\nso I accepted!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "49": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9ebf19b70f949a6bff768210b6e1ca2dbdc3f29ef1b3c70353bfbf0dd21aac84",
      "text": "—Qualia Tech-Con. They want to\nsettle their brother rivalry on that\nstage.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:74d0eaf1784358153544b5494a7ad29848456cdadd54731bf4f014b02906d375",
      "text": "Wow... All famous companies...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "60": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9c680391b406f6cd6c0df47570c60af3128e2514e44da2643b3c92c76158e0a",
      "text": "Qualia Tech-Con. An annual\ncelebration of corporate cutting-edge\ntech.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "65": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cd3777e7c71e5857a35f5c22831d070e4b8b788fb8a6fa141dabf49c2fc633ff",
      "text": "Heh heh... I can't believe it.\nI get to take part in Tech-Con!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "69": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2d7939571babc2ad62ab1ebb1cf47b91958381a0759744bc45eb59ec2fa5b175",
      "text": "You're so carefree... A big company\npicks a fight and forces you into a\ncompetition. It's public humiliation!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:608a59a0f9439d3fbec11212ca804c014f366f59ac32d7dbe4dc3f89f5b27bbc",
      "text": "Bring it on! Whoever gets talked\nabout wins! The boss would say so.\nI agree.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:43ccf7d9eeb9d1f8a2fdf7e4a5ff051eea70294052d117fcbbd86c36e7f00092",
      "text": "You really are shrewd...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a4f2b8d5d28c00759b0cfefb6361e849dae7addbfb60600e2941598a32286267",
      "text": "Oh! Is that a sensory sync system?\nI can't believe I'm seeing a real\none! May I touch it? Just a little!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "88": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d36054a34cbc4252eea01ae5b04a3e79329bcd9c9d99bc6dcdd088abc4cb871",
      "text": "—Well, it's a rare chance, right?\nWhoever has fun wins. Just like\nMr. Johnson says.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "92": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9e9453d32623182be29460eac9e5984de47c3d074fff5afd96635a6c06f0cad2",
      "text": "Drag PBC's reputation through the\nmud. Completely.\n—Understood?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a7f56d759d5fab507f50365bcf0283675c288a8424bf17d1d08a2c005e517ea9",
      "text": "You face reality too, Invetra.\nJust like I did...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bbdde0d794152bd445f870bd0f3c57aae7a55c8c9013b888de60aeaeab40ba98",
      "text": "—And here we go! The tech contest to\ndecide this year's best! First up,\nMegatro Techno!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2d3ad0585588b711b9bfeba0c58e180e0663d43767c7cdc719e15dd10028846d",
      "text": "Being scored in front of the crowd...\nAgh, even watching makes my stomach\nhurt.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3e8dd97baaa6ea74a0291f5f75dc087e1e12bf250c672998ca684f928d597bb5",
      "text": "Invetra will be fine.\n—Look, he's up next.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d5cfe2e0c6a6af2a878f0723f97030b2af11e7919344021dc5f0608132aded73",
      "text": "—How do you like it? PBC Hero\nDevelopment's gadgets are a cut above\nthe usual machines!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bcd2b1a6ba2333f90afbb7d26523d66fc2fd445abc86478b9ca2b5263b0252af",
      "text": "This Kingfisher Device is a\nbreakthrough, combining a matter-\npenetrating film and pseudo-material—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "117": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c55c0928a8691c7e848d2665b6f087a20a5fb2dd807b1100fc7137e1d9f3e44",
      "text": "Ah, Invetra, was it? You've crammed\nin the latest trendy tech. Well, of\ncourse it's amazing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9f3bbf33e93a53f876e83ca091dafb4efa98c339475e9dc4f0a3235b90529384",
      "text": "That's just a waste, isn't it? What\nabout cost? Delivery date? Prospects\nfor mass production?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "122": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cc73b957bfc703eb71c95bddb9f55acc984c9728551b5250548f8c760f3f95db",
      "text": "...That's...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a7d177b1b9ff5c0795df64c50a69f58b3a1cd4256a56adef542db25b0b3bb3cb",
      "text": "Hmph, this is mere dabbling. This\nis a place for serious business.\nToymakers, step aside.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bd7a574a1966c6641543b20996f7b7e37e0cb82cbbbdc56559976147b8791ff9",
      "text": "It's okay.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1cfcbb2bd8749fda17ba26536a9c18f2578063d7bb84741bafea9bbc701e1d2a",
      "text": "I see. —What's wrong with toys?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dcc15d2368ea5b61c0dc379461e9e3c10eba892b02d36e37ab23834d1c48bdf6",
      "text": "From your view, my inventions may\nbe \"toys.\" But that matters, doesn't\nit?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58561d444f37248354787a063a39092b6d12c89a682f64afd7b70265485d1550",
      "text": "Hero Gadgets aren't just tools.\nThey're symbols of their justice, a\nsign of hope.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "144": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa802d3bbb6a441311f274818811aa3387d1252d9b62a86b253c4b34fa9c174b",
      "text": "Because they sparkle and shine\nbrilliantly, they pierce someone's\nheart. That's how we're moved, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "147": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21943a6661d8217cdd59a6d50e75a673d4d925c8689337743b834f544ac2bfdb",
      "text": "Look, that's just an excuse, isn't\nit? No cost sense, no mass production\nplan, that's not a product—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:604762f3abfadf49e60f334e10813588b8bdb4a87f96c831a8973c18d2c7f4a5",
      "text": "Of course, I accept objections.\nSleek efficiency and unseen\nperformance are the coolest too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:40beab074c7c721a6cf66a30a2506b58748a84f83b6a9cece532f4ef7857bfcd",
      "text": "But what I love is \"this.\" And I've\ngot companions who love it with me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fb237819ac1da40a29a47cd03ebe917e58692beeb991faa57cdf177fb31c9218",
      "text": "People see dreams in what they long\nfor. That's the cool I'm aiming for.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d639c299dea6920e5bdd0133fa98081eee974b3e1652c52ea787beacbb82738",
      "text": "—So I'll keep going! Toward the\nultimate cool I believe in!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "164": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58075023f50d63d35580f76f6205c602d49160e3820f7bfd7b4a77c8d96c4ae0",
      "text": "...Yeah. That's Invetra for you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97618a33c1b659398420bcb1713491c5169faf59acd83542b1b83c90c39fd2f1",
      "text": "So, did we lose in the end? Not\nproducing results is hard to defend\nas a company, you know.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "172": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7432e1a3d89be78762b33371a62c3a6db3486c872b522c1b9b857e006a76dd63",
      "text": "Says the man who knew about the\nacquisition and let it be.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8be29d4565d1b39e4541a79d9fa87068a7b41f6ae5038bf11bb9004102127dfc",
      "text": "I was busy sowing seeds and making\nplans, too! Couldn't I get a little\nappreciation!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:794f917e6f26a9d6d9068a297ccbb0d7be7f32941a070e5d2e1806113b78aefd",
      "text": "Well, we got results beyond\nrankings, at least.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "184": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e7bb98ac60aee0c69b2a32a887f3705851bb039098722b2a3c7a486cfa37521d",
      "text": "Invetra, what you just did really\nmoved me! I became an engineer\nbecause of anime too...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f15b6f9bcc0bbdccbea234ba5e10f01834b9bf19506d2ed62e4aec19a03478ac",
      "text": "Keep running down your razor-sharp\npath! I'll follow wherever you go!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "189": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9e9414f59b961580b9d62db738132efd02e0aa1b9739efd63c521cf5ea860ed8",
      "text": "Heh, thanks. If you'd like, please\nsubscribe to my channel and follow\non social media—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "192": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:69557758e681c1088f8dea096f9b8534c7d45be098026e4d74d5ba442694dba3",
      "text": "Don't let it go to your head. No\nmatter how many hobby friends you\ngain, it means nothing—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ac84dfa5d2414e708e2e6d812d51420acba9eee729b586573708508c8d24ac60",
      "text": "Wait for me, Brother. Next time,\nI'll make you say my gadgets are\ncool.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:20d9ad1e67221a854bd7b2112b29044409982b565678f3334f3181d360e99a80",
      "text": "...Hmph.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d659aa17a99327829dd38656cf4222081d2dcf03e0e0cc1439eb5b6c9a4a3584",
      "text": "...I won't give up. Apparently I'm\na brother-complex.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d144440529dcecb9e2022a9bab12c64221f779a3d24795bfb82f9a8400fa12d",
      "text": "I know.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3fdb5562a34658583bc0c730b15f6bb68e614d8d100f168e378931fe2bcc567",
      "text": "High-rise building hijack. Please\nrespond immediately~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3842c6ba544b22963924840925e576f2976c236a9eb96d627a3fb91dbc3e9cff",
      "text": "—Let's go, Heroes! My gadget is\nalways ready!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
